        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2147_8045.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willige</unclear> dienst, und
<lb n="2"/>was wir ehren liebs und guots vermoegendt, zuvor
<lb n="3"/>Fromen Fuersichtigen, Ehrsamen und Weisen, In-
<lb n="4"/>sonders <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Freunde</unclear>, und getreüwen lieben Nach-
<lb n="5"/>barn.
<lb n="6"/>Was abermahls, wegen eines <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffbruchs</unclear> vor-
<lb n="7"/>handen, daß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdt</unclear> ihr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zweiffels</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frey</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euwer</unclear> und unser getreuwen lieben eidtgnossen
<lb n="9"/>von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-32" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Zürich</placeName> bey eignen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laeuffersbotten</unclear> abge-
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fertigten</unclear> schreiben, allbereit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">notturfft</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>verstanden haben.
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Auf</unclear> solches seindt wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weiters</unclear> ver-
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">treüwlich</unclear> berichtet worden, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dieser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear>-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zug</unclear> bis <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">9000</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mannen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">starckh</unclear> sein werde.
<lb n="15"/>Demnach so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werde</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volckh</unclear> im <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Meyländischen</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stado</unclear> (welches daselbst auß den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Guarnisonen</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genomen</unclear> werde) auf den <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">16</unclear> 26 diß</date> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aufbrechen</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>und anziehen, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weere</unclear> gleich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vff</unclear> <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nechstkünff</unclear>-
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">donstag</unclear></date>.
<lb n="20"/>Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hatt</unclear> man <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewisse</unclear> nachrichtung, daß
<lb n="21"/>diß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">volckh</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bevelch</unclear> habe, sich in der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Länderen</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>dienst gebrauchen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zulassen</unclear>.
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">So</unclear> sollen auch die fünff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Orth</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">samt</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-197" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Frey</unclear>-
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burg</unclear></placeName> und <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-49" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Solothurn</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschlossen</unclear> haben, wo-
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ferr</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-13" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bern</unclear></placeName> nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werde</unclear> cedieren, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">od</unclear>
<lb n="26"/>nachgeben, daß sie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alßdann</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewüß</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>ein Infall und angriff thun werden.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2147_8046.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> solchem ende, armiere man nicht allein
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heimblich</unclear> zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-69" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Lucern</placeName>; sondern auch in allen
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bavemeldten</unclear> Orthen.
<lb n="31"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachbarn</unclear> der <persName resp="#ner">herr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Abbt</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sanctgallen</unclear></persName>,
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sambt</unclear> dem von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-389" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mury</unclear></placeName> und <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-421" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Wettingen</placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seyendt</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bey</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einandern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewesen</unclear>, haben ihre
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rhatschlaeg</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuosammen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getragen</unclear>, und werde
<lb n="35"/>der allhiesige <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heimlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erweüß</unclear> armieren.
<lb n="36"/>Solche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeitungen</unclear> habendt wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">für</unclear> würdig ge-
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">achtet</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Euch</unclear> unsern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getreüwen</unclear> lieben Nach-
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">barn</unclear> auch bey <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eignem</unclear> botten nachbarlich
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> communicieren. Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demnach</unclear>
<lb n="40"/>noch Niemandts <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weißt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welchen</unclear> weg
<lb n="41"/>der durchzug eigentlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moechte</unclear> genommen
<lb n="42"/>werden, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">villeicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Grentzen</unclear> auch
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">betreffen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moechte</unclear>. Damit dann
<lb n="44"/>deßhalb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsers</unclear> theils die notturfft, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">man</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschonete</unclear>, bey guoter
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeit</unclear> an die handt genommen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nüts</unclear> ver-
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habendt</unclear> wir von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">noethen</unclear>
<lb n="48"/>sein erachtet, daß
<lb n="49"/>wir über solche sachen
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einandern</unclear>
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underredten</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Es</unclear> ge-
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">langt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derowegen</unclear>
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündtnachbarlichst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ge</unclear>-
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sinnen</unclear>, Ihr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollent</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unbeschwaert</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uf</unclear> <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">naechst</unclear>-
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kommenden</unclear> Sambstag</date> oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eher</unclear>, wann es
<lb n="56"/>Eüch gelegen sein moechte etliche auß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ewers</unclear>
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhats</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mittel</unclear> zuo unsern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hiezuo</unclear> verordneten
<lb n="58"/>mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bevelch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allhero</unclear> abordnen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">disere</unclear>
<lb n="59"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beyd</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anders</unclear>
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geliebte</unclear> Vatter-
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">betreffende</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">notturfftig</unclear>-
<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">clich</unclear>
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einandern</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2147_8047.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubedenkhen</unclear>, und so mans <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">funde</unclear>, gleich
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anwurffungs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wege</unclear> am selben tag den herren Abbt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daselbst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbs</unclear>
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzuesprechen</unclear>, und also dahin <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">arbeiten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">helffen</unclear>,
<lb n="67"/>wie wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschwaerden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">entuebriget</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pleiben</unclear>
<lb n="68"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moechten</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inmassen</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolbewueßt</unclear>,
<lb n="69"/>daß ihr deß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euewrig</unclear> gern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuen</unclear> werden, und
<lb n="70"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euech</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwinden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fernerhalb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euewrer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fl</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gott</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bittende</unclear>,
<lb n="72"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">antwort</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auf</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> uns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">samptlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> allen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefaehrlichkeiten</unclear>
<lb n="73"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hohohe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sachen</unclear> bewahren, und in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guetem</unclear> frid und wolstandt
<lb n="74"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geliebten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vatterlands</unclear> erhalten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolle</unclear>.
<lb n="75"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeuerzeichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ob</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demnach</unclear> Datum den <origDate when="1619-09-14" resp="#ner">14. septembris anno 1619</origDate>.
<lb n="76"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soles</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ervolge</unclear>.
<lb n="77"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und rhat
<lb n="78"/>der statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Santgallen</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="79"/>An <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-565" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Landtamann</unclear> und rhat der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußeren</unclear>
